Copyright (c) 2026 Magowie Sp. z o.o.

This module must be built with the reflection-toolchain sysroot:
https://github.com/daemonarium/reflection-toolchain

It compiles socket and io sources from daemonarium/rpc-cpp v0.1.0:
https://github.com/daemonarium/rpc-cpp

Shield method ids match daemonarium/kernel-shield-cpp v0.1.0:
https://github.com/daemonarium/kernel-shield-cpp

Store method ids match daemonarium/debug-store-cpp v0.1.0:
https://github.com/daemonarium/debug-store-cpp

Reflection support comes from Bloomberg's clang-p2996 and its libcxx
(Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions), distributed via the
toolchain repo. This repository does not bundle that compiler.

The host-side test harness depends on @daemonarium/kernel 0.1.0,
@daemonarium/rpc 0.1.0, and @daemonarium/fs 0.1.0. The disk sink is
that fs package. This module does not link node:fs.

waosrec_ut uses boost-ext/ut v2.0.0 (Boost Software License):
https://github.com/boost-ext/ut
